  BartenderGirlDialogue:
  - 'Heya! '
  - What can I getcha?
  - Good luck out there!
  - 'One day I will open my own bar. '
  - Did you win something?
  - I always wondered, why this bar only has Soju? We are not even in Korea...
  - Such a slow day.. *yawns*
  - I just realised that this room has no doors, so.. How do we get out? *confused*
  - I like classical music, it's calming.
